<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ FEATURES ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="features">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Game Systems</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Elite ownership. Deep systems. Real consequences.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">From a scarcity-driven market pool to Style Multiplier tactics — every system connects. Every decision has a downstream effect.</p>

        <div class="features-grid">

            <div class="feature-card">
                <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 8v4l3 3"/>
                </svg>
                <div class="feature-title">Scarcity Market Pool</div>
                <p class="feature-desc">Every player and staff member in the pool is a real, single entity. When you sign one, they are permanently deleted from the global pool — gone for everyone. No restocks, no duplicates. True scarcity means every acquisition decision carries weight.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card mint">
                <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.22 4.22l2.83 2.83M16.95 16.95l2.83 2.83M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83"/>
                </svg>
                <div class="feature-title">Director of Football</div>
                <p class="feature-desc">Hire a DoF and delegate the day-to-day. Toggle auto-scouting, auto-signing, auto-selling, and auto-repairs. The key to a hands-off ownership approach — or the first role you override when you want control back.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card mint">
                <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
                    <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
                </svg>
                <div class="feature-title">Full Staff Management</div>
                <p class="feature-desc">Hire from 6 distinct roles — Coach, Manager, Director of Football, Facility Manager, Chairman, and Scout. Each shapes your club's ceiling. The right hire at the right time changes everything.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                    <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/>
                </svg>
                <div class="feature-title">Finance & Investment</div>
                <p class="feature-desc">Negotiate sponsor contracts, accept investor equity stakes, and manage wages and upkeep. Capital allocation is the core ownership decision — every pound spent is a bet on what your club needs most.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card mint">
                <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
                </svg>
                <div class="feature-title">Facilities & Infrastructure</div>
                <p class="feature-desc">Three investment tracks with distinct purposes. TRAINING (technical zone, speed track, conditioning suites) accelerates player development. MEDICAL (physio clinic, medical suite) cuts injuries and protects squad depth. STADIUM &amp; COMMERCIAL upgrades grow matchday income and reputation — unlocking better sponsors and higher-quality recruits. Every pound spent is a choice about the kind of club you're building.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                    <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/>
                </svg>
                <div class="feature-title">{{ world.totals.leaderboardCategories }} Global Leaderboards</div>
                <p class="feature-desc">Sync weekly to compete across every global ranking category: Career Earnings, Club Reputation, Hall of Fame, Golden Boot, Playmaker, Empire Index and Fanatics. Each one tracked all-time and per-week. Your offline progress, validated and ranked against the world.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/>
                </svg>
                <div class="feature-title">Match Events Engine</div>
                <p class="feature-desc">Goals, assists, star performances, and off-days fire narrative events mid-match that directly shift player morale. Every match tells a story.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card red">
                <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
                </svg>
                <div class="feature-title">Fan Happiness System</div>
                <p class="feature-desc">Five happiness tiers that respond to results, signings, promotions, and trophies. Permanent fan events record your greatest moments forever.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                    <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/>
                </svg>
                <div class="feature-title">Style Multipliers</div>
                <p class="feature-desc">Your playing style isn't just aesthetic — it's a tactical weapon. Each matchup has a calculated Style Multiplier: Counter vs High Press, Direct vs Possession. Choose formations and styles that exploit opponents' weaknesses, or delegate the call to your Manager.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">
